<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-5755] Wrong msg: calculation of memory policy size</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5755</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In PageMemoryNoStoreImpl:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;            throw new IgniteOutOfMemoryException(&quot;Not enough memory allocated &quot; +
                &quot;(consider increasing memory policy size or enabling evictions) &quot; +
                &quot;[policyName=&quot; + memoryPolicyCfg.getName() +
                &quot;, size=&quot; + U.readableSize(memoryPolicyCfg.getMaxSize(), true) + &quot;]&quot;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;wrong usage of U.readableSize - we should use non &quot;Si&quot; (1024 instead of 1000) multiplier. Right code is:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;            throw new IgniteOutOfMemoryException(&quot;Not enough memory allocated &quot; +
                &quot;(consider increasing memory policy size or enabling evictions) &quot; +
                &quot;[policyName=&quot; + memoryPolicyCfg.getName() +
                &quot;, size=&quot; + U.readableSize(memoryPolicyCfg.getMaxSize(), false) + &quot;]&quot;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
